  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Upper Egypt &#x2013; Support in Ecosystem Mapping, May 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to provide assistance in the preparation and execution of a thorough mapping of the current entrepreneurial ecosystem in Upper Egypt. By extensive desk research and by engaging directly with local incubation programmes, knowledge institutions, government organisations, entrepreneurial champions, aspiring students and all other relevant stakeholders, an assessment of the current ecosystem is delivered.</narrative>
  </description>
